  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 803.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the classification of and licensing requirements for nursing home facilities pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(e)(2) and as described in RSA 151:9, VII(a)(3).\n\nSource. #2191, eff 11-25-82; amd by #2640, eff 3-7-84; ss by #3193, eff 1-28-86; amd by #4232, eff 2-23-87; amd by #4349, eff 12-28-87; amd by #4517, eff 10-28-88; ss by #5317, EMERGENCY, eff 1-29-92, EXPIRED: 5-28-92\n\nNew. #5644, eff 6-23-93; ss by #7020, INTERIM, eff 6-23-99, EXPIRED: 10-21-99\n\nNew. #9856-A, eff 1-26-11, EXPIRED: 1-26-19\n\nNew. #12721, INTERIM, eff 1-29-19, EXPIRED: 7-29-19\n\nNew. #12860, eff 8-28-19",
